<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais set warrants on insurance basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais set warrants on insurance basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Finance (Gurnsey) has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on an Italian insurance sector basket, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>The basket includes shares on Assicurazioni Generali, Istituto Nazionale delle Assicuraziono, Alleanza Assicurazioni, Riunioni Adriatica di Sicurta SpA, La Fondiaria Assicurazioni, Mediolanum SpA, Societa Assicuratrice Industriale, Toro Assicurazioni and Compagnia Assicurstrice Unipol. </p>
<p>The basket is unequally weighted.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 PCT OF REFERENCE PRICE</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     22.75 PCT OF REFERENCE PRICE</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.JUL.97-01.JUL.99   PAYDATE	15.JUL.97</p>
<p> GEARING	   4.395 X</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  VALUE OF BASKET ON 01.JUL.97.</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  CL5K</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
